```text
Omega = Fix_N(A(lim_{n->infinity} F^(n)(0->1)))
```

## Evidence layer

```text
Delta -> R(Delta) -> S -> U:S->S' -> O(S,S') -> reproducible evidence
```

## Successor layer

```text
E_(n+1) = Closure(E_n union DeltaE_(n+1))
E_n subseteq E_(n+1)
A(E_n*) = E_n*
```

## Infrared observational layer

```text
W_obs(E) = {admissible microscopic models} / observational_indistinguishability_at_E
```

## Condensate

> Fundamental is not every imagined microscopic difference, but a difference that becomes relationally defined, state-bearing, causally effective, reproducibly evidenced, and remains admissible under exact reobservation. Closure is local; scientific continuation remains open.

The combination is called an **evidence spiral** rather than a final ring because every exact local closure can be retained as an immutable evidence object while a successor evidence state is constructed.

This document records a formal and scientific organizing synthesis. It does not assert that the complete physical universe has been empirically proved to instantiate the formal model, nor that all physical ontology has been proved finite-binary.
